# Traefik dashboard basic-auth credentials (htpasswd format), one user per line.
#
# Copy this file to `traefik/dashboard-users` (which is gitignored) and set a
# real credential. Generate an entry with either:
#   htpasswd -nB admin > traefik/dashboard-users
#   openssl passwd -apr1 'your-password' | sed 's/^/admin:/' > traefik/dashboard-users
#
# The real file is read directly by Traefik, so keep it to credential lines only
# (no comments). The default below is admin / changeme — CHANGE IT.
admin:$apr1$ExmA3.So$vJX/bCXJ3RgU8XUWueYsl1
